# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a short jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim).
# Played by audio/jingles.js: game/quests.js, a quest taken.
title    Quest taken
composer Claude
about    A quest taken: the bird's wide call, then a second call a fourth higher, left open like a question, over an open glass harmonica chord and a glass tap.
tempo    100
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.55

# mood explore: bird harm tap

voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.3  rev=0.75
voice harm     glassharp  vol=0.2  pan=-0.2 center=A4 att=0.15 rel=1
voice tap      glasstap   vol=0.28 pan=0.35

pattern open
bird    | E6 A5+B5---- A6 D6+E6---- |
harm    | [Asus2]?----------- |
tap     | x..... x..... |

loop open
